Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Export a slate JSON bundle beside the Pages HTML.

board.json is serialized from the Board kernel so priced_markets (Picks)
and flagged_tiles (Gems) keep the existing Tile.priced / GEM_EDGE_PTS /
GEM_STATES rules. build.json and record.json carry the producer promotion
verdict, may_bet, and unmet_gates unchanged. The deploy smoke now checks
the three artifacts.
